<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Philadelphia Suburban.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Philadelphia Suburban.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HSBC Washington Analysis said it initiated coverage of Philadelphia Suburban Corp with a hold recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The company is a regulated water utility servicing 267,000 customers in four counties north and west of Philadelphia, the third largest investor-owned water utility in the United States.</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimates are $1.03 per share for 1996 and $1.12 in 1997, according to a research note by analysts Debra Cov and Gregg Orrill.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 18-3/4 in morning NYSE trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
